15
00:01:53,820 --> 00:02:01,330
On Standing on Shoulders. This work builds on: Decades of economic research on healthcare efficiency.

16
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:08,600
Clinical trial methodology from thousands of researchers. Open-source software from millions of developers.

17
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:17,620
Data from governments, N.G.O.s, and research institutions. The accumulated wisdom of humans who realized spending on murder

18
00:02:17,620 --> 00:02:27,860
